# 20. Creating Your First EKS Cluster

Example:

```bash
eksctl create cluster \
--name demo-cluster \
--region ap-south-1 \
--nodegroup-name workers \
--node-type t3.medium \
--nodes 2
```

This creates:

```text
EKS Cluster

|

Control Plane

|

Worker Nodes

|

Pods
```

---

