# 22. Deploy Your First Application

Create nginx deployment:

```bash
kubectl create deployment nginx \
--image=nginx
```

---

Check:

```bash
kubectl get deployment
```

---

View Pods:

```bash
kubectl get pods
```

Example:

```text
nginx-abc123

Running
```

---

# 23. Expose Application

Create Service:

```bash
kubectl expose deployment nginx \
--type=LoadBalancer \
--port=80
```

Check:

```bash
kubectl get service
```

Output:

```text
EXTERNAL-IP

xxxxx.elb.amazonaws.com
```

Traffic flow:

```text
User

↓

AWS Load Balancer

↓

Service

↓

Pod

↓

Nginx
```

