--name demo-cluster
```

---

View nodes:

```bash
kubectl get nodes
```

---

View all resources:

```bash
kubectl get all
```

---

Cluster information:

```bash
kubectl cluster-info
```

---

# 29. Deleting EKS Cluster

Remove cluster:

```bash
eksctl delete cluster \
--name demo-cluster
```

Always delete unused clusters to avoid AWS charges.

